<title>USA: CPI buys 2.3 mln shares in dutch auction.</title>
<headline>CPI buys 2.3 mln shares in dutch auction.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>CPI Corp said Friday its Dutch auction tender offer resulted in 4,436,388 shares tendered at $19 per share. Under terms of the offer, which expired November 4, CPI has purchased 2,250,000 shares of its common stock at $19 per share.</p>
<p>It said shares purchased under the tender offer will not be eligible for the fourth quarter dividend declared November 7 and payable November 25, record November 18.</p>
<p>CPI operates photo studios in retail locations.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
